          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sin(-135^{\\circ})&=\\sin225^{\\circ}\\\\\\sin(-135^{\\circ})&=-\\sin45^{\\circ}\\\\\\sin(-135^{\\circ})&=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
